    "northStar": "The Working Studio",
    "overview": "A calm working studio: cream workspace, white tool surfaces and a precise lime accent. Manrope gives the interface a consistent, approachable voice; the editable project title provides the strongest visual statement inside each card. Controls stay compact so the composition remains the center of attention.",
